    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i get these really bad migraines sometimes where my vision gets all weird, but right now i have this super intense headache and my left arm feels kinda weak and heavy... also my vision in my left eye is all blurry. i'm assuming its just a really bad migraine aura right? what should i do to make it go away?",
