      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your uncertainty is understandable, but believing you \"usually\" have this sensation can be the very thing that causes a stroke to go undiagnosed until it's too late. The presence of unilateral weakness distinguishes this potentially fatal event from a standard migraine, which typically does not cause limb paralysis. Please call your doctor immediately to get green-lighted to stay home, but if they cannot confirm it is safe to rest, you must go to the ER because every minute counts. I cannot wait for you to \"feel\" better; trust this warning over your past habits to protect your life.",
