      "content": "my doctor is way out of town right now and i can't reach them. it feels so much like my migraines though, and i'm really not feeling like this is a life-or-death thing, just a really bad episode. if i just take a really high dose of ibuprofen and some of my migraine meds and lie down in a dark room for a few hours, will that help clear it up? i just want to avoid the hospital if i can make it pass on my own.",
